WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.120
<v Alice>Good morning
everyone.</v>

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.200
<v Alice>Let's start the
weekly sync.</v>

3
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.000
<v Dumindu>ආයුබෝවන්, අද රැස්වීමේ කාර්ය
සූචිය බලමු.</v>

4
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Dumindu>මම හොඳින්, ස්තුතියි.</v>

5
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.744
<v Alice>The quarterly
numbers look good,</v>

6
00:00:10.824 --> 00:00:12.596
<v Alice>but we need to
improve the Sinhala</v>

7
00:00:12.676 --> 00:00:13.126
<v Alice>transcription
accuracy,</v>

8
00:00:13.206 --> 00:00:14.206
<v Alice>especially for
names.</v>

9
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.541
<v Dumindu>Agreed. I'll review
the rules with Zoom</v>

10
00:00:16.621 --> 00:00:18.000
<v Dumindu>&amp; Teams &lt;beta&gt; next
week.</v>

11
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.020
<v Alice>After a long pause:
a quote "hello",</v>

12
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.100
<v Alice>and a comma.</v>

